+---
+"@lynx-js/motion": patch
+---
+
+Complete declarative variant orchestration: `delayChildren: stagger()`, `staggerChildren`/`staggerDirection` (components without variants are transparent to stagger order), `when: "afterChildren"`, and `when: "beforeChildren"` with automatic durations now wait for real completion. Add `useAnimationControls`/`useAnimation` for `animate={controls}` with variant propagation, and propagate `whileTap`/`whileHover` variant labels to variant children. `stagger()` can now also be called from render code.
